{"seq":1,"slug":"fetch-lifecycle-patterns","title":"请求生命周期与模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-data-fetching-patterns/fundamentals/fetch-lifecycle-patterns","wordCount":1272,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"请求生命周期与模式\">请求生命周期与模式</h1><p>一次数据请求从用户操作触发到最终渲染在屏幕上，经历了状态初始化、网络传输、响应解析、缓存写入和 UI 同步五个阶段。理解这个完整生命周期是构建健壮数据层的第一步——每个阶段都有对应的失败模式和优化空间。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>二维状态模型</strong>：TanStack Query v5 将请求状态拆分为 <code>status</code>（数据存在性）与 <code>fetchStatus</code>（网络活跃性）两个正交维度，精确区分&quot;首次加载&quot;与&quot;后台刷新&quot;</li>\n<li><strong>声明式数据依赖</strong>：组件描述需要什么数据，框架决定何时获取——将请求去重、缓存命中等复杂逻辑从业务代码中抽离</li>\n<li><strong>竞态条件防护</strong>：通过 AbortController 实现真正的请求取消，而非仅忽略过时响应</li>\n<li><strong>请求去重</strong>：同一时间窗口内对相同 key 的多次调用合并为一次网络请求，多组件共享同一 Promise</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"请求的五阶段状态模型\">请求的五阶段状态模型</h2><p>传统的 <code>loading / success / error</code> 三态模型在 TanStack Query v5 中被证明是不充分的。v5 引入了 <code>status</code>（数据是否存在）与 <code>fetchStatus</code>（网络请求是否进行中）的正交二维模型：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"stateDiagram-v2\" data-source=\"stateDiagram-v2&#10;    [*] --&gt; Pending: 首次挂载&#10;    Pending --&gt; Success: 数据返回&#10;    Pending --&gt; Error: 请求失败&#10;    Success --&gt; Success: 后台重验证完成&#10;    Success --&gt; Error: 重验证失败但保留旧数据&#10;    Error --&gt; Pending: 手动重试&#10;    Error --&gt; Success: 自动重试成功\">stateDiagram-v2\n    [*] --&gt; Pending: 首次挂载\n    Pending --&gt; Success: 数据返回\n    Pending --&gt; Error: 请求失败\n    Success --&gt; Success: 后台重验证完成\n    Success --&gt; Error: 重验证失败但保留旧数据\n    Error --&gt; Pending: 手动重试\n    Error --&gt; Success: 自动重试成功</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>status / fetchStatus</th>\n<th>fetching</th>\n<th>paused</th>\n<th>idle</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>pending</strong></td>\n<td>首次加载中</td>\n<td>离线暂停</td>\n<td>未触发（disabled）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>success</strong></td>\n<td>后台重验证</td>\n<td>离线等待重验证</td>\n<td>数据新鲜</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>error</strong></td>\n<td>重试中</td>\n<td>离线等待重试</td>\n<td>最终失败</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这个模型解决了 v4 中 <code>isLoading</code> 语义混乱的问题——<code>isPending</code>（无数据）与 <code>isFetching</code>（网络活跃）的含义不再重叠。对开发者而言，这意味着可以精确区分&quot;首次加载骨架屏&quot;和&quot;有旧数据时的静默刷新&quot;两种 UI 状态。</p>\n<h2 id=\"命令式-vs-声明式请求\">命令式 vs 声明式请求</h2><p>数据请求的发起范式经历了从命令式到声明式的演进。命令式风格要求开发者手动管理请求时机：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 命令式：手动控制何时请求&#10;const fetchUser = async (id: string) =&gt; {&#10;  setLoading(true);&#10;  try {&#10;    const res = await fetch(`/api/users/${id}`);&#10;    const data = await res.json();&#10;    setUser(data);&#10;  } catch (e) {&#10;    setError(e);&#10;  } finally {&#10;    setLoading(false);&#10;  }&#10;};&#10;&#10;useEffect(() =&gt; {&#10;  fetchUser(userId);&#10;}, [userId]);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 命令式：手动控制何时请求</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fetchUser</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> async</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  setLoading</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  try</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> res</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fetch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`/api/users/${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">id</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> data</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> res.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">json</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    setUser</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(data);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">catch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (e) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    setError</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(e);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">finally</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    setLoading</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">useEffect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  fetchUser</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(userId);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}, [userId]);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>声明式风格将请求视为数据依赖的副产品——组件声明它需要什么数据，框架决定何时获取：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 声明式：描述依赖，框架决定时机&#10;const { data: user, isPending } = useQuery({&#10;  queryKey: [&#39;users&#39;, userId],&#10;  queryFn: () =&gt; fetch(`/api/users/${userId}`).then((r) =&gt; r.json()),&#10;  enabled: !!userId,&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 声明式：描述依赖，框架决定时机</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">data</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">user</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">isPending</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> useQuery</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  queryKey: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'users'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, userId],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  queryFn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fetch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`/api/users/${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">userId</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">then</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> r.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">json</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  enabled: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">userId,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><p>声明式模型的核心优势不仅是代码量减少，而是将请求去重、缓存命中、后台重验证等复杂逻辑从业务代码中完全抽离。当多个组件依赖同一份数据时，命令式方案需要手动协调（通常通过全局 store），声明式方案则自动完成请求合并。</p>\n<h2 id=\"竞态条件与请求取消\">竞态条件与请求取消</h2><p>当用户快速切换筛选条件或页面时，先发出的请求可能晚于后发的请求返回，导致 UI 显示过时数据。这是前端数据请求中最常见的 bug 来源：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 竞态条件示例：userId 快速变化&#10;useEffect(() =&gt; {&#10;  let cancelled = false;&#10;&#10;  fetch(`/api/users/${userId}`)&#10;    .then((r) =&gt; r.json())&#10;    .then((data) =&gt; {&#10;      if (!cancelled) setUser(data); // 闭包守卫&#10;    });&#10;&#10;  return () =&gt; {&#10;    cancelled = true;&#10;  };&#10;}, [userId]);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 竞态条件示例：userId 快速变化</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">useEffect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cancelled </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  fetch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`/api/users/${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">userId</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">then</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> r.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">json</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">then</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">data</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">cancelled) </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">setUser</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(data); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 闭包守卫</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    cancelled </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}, [userId]);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>现代解决方案使用 <code>AbortController</code> 实现真正的请求取消，而非仅忽略响应：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"useEffect(() =&gt; {&#10;  const controller = new AbortController();&#10;&#10;  fetch(`/api/users/${userId}`, { signal: controller.signal })&#10;    .then((r) =&gt; r.json())&#10;    .then(setUser)&#10;    .catch((e) =&gt; {&#10;      if (e.name !== &#39;AbortError&#39;) setError(e);&#10;    });&#10;&#10;  return () =&gt; controller.abort();&#10;}, [userId]);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">useEffect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> controller</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> AbortController</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  fetch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`/api/users/${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">userId</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, { signal: controller.signal })</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">then</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> r.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">json</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">then</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(setUser)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">catch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (e.name </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!==</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'AbortError'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">setError</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(e);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> controller.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">abort</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}, [userId]);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>TanStack Query 和 SWR 内部已集成 <code>AbortController</code>——当 queryKey 变化时自动取消前一个请求。开发者只需在 <code>queryFn</code> 中传递 signal 参数即可享受这一能力。</p>\n<h2 id=\"请求去重与共享\">请求去重与共享</h2><p>多个组件同时挂载且依赖相同数据时，朴素实现会发出多个相同请求。请求去重（request deduplication）在给定时间窗口内将相同 key 的多次请求合并为一次网络调用：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant A as 组件 A&#10;    participant B as 组件 B&#10;    participant Cache as 缓存层&#10;    participant Server as 服务端&#10;&#10;    A-&gt;&gt;Cache: useQuery([&#39;user&#39;, 1])&#10;    B-&gt;&gt;Cache: useQuery([&#39;user&#39;, 1])&#10;    Cache-&gt;&gt;Server: GET /api/users/1(仅一次)&#10;    Server--&gt;&gt;Cache: 响应数据&#10;    Cache--&gt;&gt;A: 返回数据&#10;    Cache--&gt;&gt;B: 返回数据(同一引用)\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant A as 组件 A\n    participant B as 组件 B\n    participant Cache as 缓存层\n    participant Server as 服务端\n\n    A-&gt;&gt;Cache: useQuery(['user', 1])\n    B-&gt;&gt;Cache: useQuery(['user', 1])\n    Cache-&gt;&gt;Server: GET /api/users/1(仅一次)\n    Server--&gt;&gt;Cache: 响应数据\n    Cache--&gt;&gt;A: 返回数据\n    Cache--&gt;&gt;B: 返回数据(同一引用)</pre><p>SWR 通过 <code>dedupingInterval</code>（默认 2000ms）控制去重窗口：在此时间内对同一 key 的多次调用只触发一次实际请求。TanStack Query 的去重则基于 query 的 <code>status</code>——当一个 query 处于 <code>fetching</code> 状态时，所有新的订阅者自动共享这个进行中的 Promise。</p>\n<h2 id=\"依赖请求与串行获取\">依赖请求与串行获取</h2><p>当请求 B 的参数依赖请求 A 的结果时，产生串行依赖。所有主流库都提供了声明式处理方式：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// TanStack Query：通过 enabled 控制依赖&#10;const { data: user } = useQuery({&#10;  queryKey: [&#39;user&#39;, userId],&#10;  queryFn: () =&gt; fetchUser(userId),&#10;});&#10;&#10;const { data: projects } = useQuery({&#10;  queryKey: [&#39;projects&#39;, user?.orgId],&#10;  queryFn: () =&gt; fetchProjects(user!.orgId),&#10;  enabled: !!user?.orgId, // user 加载完成前不触发&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// TanStack Query：通过 enabled 控制依赖</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">data</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">user</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> useQuery</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  queryKey: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'user'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, userId],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  queryFn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fetchUser</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(userId),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">data</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">projects</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> useQuery</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  queryKey: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'projects'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, user?.orgId],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  queryFn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fetchProjects</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(user</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.orgId),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  enabled: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">user?.orgId, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// user 加载完成前不触发</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><p>依赖请求是请求瀑布流的主要成因之一。在<a href=\"../architecture/request-waterfall-optimization\">请求瀑布流优化</a>一文中，我们将系统性地讨论如何识别和消除不必要的串行依赖。</p>\n<h2 id=\"请求模式的选择矩阵\">请求模式的选择矩阵</h2><p>不同场景适用不同的请求触发模式：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模式</th>\n<th>触发时机</th>\n<th>典型场景</th>\n<th>库支持</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>挂载即请求</td>\n<td>组件 mount</td>\n<td>页面初始数据</td>\n<td>useQuery 默认行为</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>条件请求</td>\n<td>依赖满足时</td>\n<td>串行依赖</td>\n<td>enabled 选项</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>用户触发</td>\n<td>点击/提交</td>\n<td>搜索、表单</td>\n<td>useMutation / refetch</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>轮询</td>\n<td>固定间隔</td>\n<td>仪表盘</td>\n<td>refetchInterval</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>焦点触发</td>\n<td>窗口聚焦</td>\n<td>数据新鲜度</td>\n<td>refetchOnWindowFocus</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>网络恢复</td>\n<td>重新在线</td>\n<td>离线优先应用</td>\n<td>refetchOnReconnect</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>选择哪种模式取决于两个因素：数据的时效性要求（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{stale}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>——数据从新鲜变为过时的可接受时间）和用户的交互频率。高频交互 + 低时效容忍的场景（如聊天应用）倾向于实时推送而非轮询，这将在<a href=\"../advanced-patterns/realtime-subscriptions\">实时订阅与 WebSocket 集成</a>中详细讨论。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>请求生命周期的五阶段模型、二维状态矩阵和六种触发模式构成了前端数据请求的基础词汇。掌握这些概念后，下一步是理解请求返回的数据如何被<a href=\"caching-stale-revalidation\">缓存与重验证</a>——这决定了用户在后续访问时的体验质量。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"请求生命周期与模式","id":"请求生命周期与模式"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"请求的五阶段状态模型","id":"请求的五阶段状态模型"},{"level":2,"text":"命令式 vs 声明式请求","id":"命令式-vs-声明式请求"},{"level":2,"text":"竞态条件与请求取消","id":"竞态条件与请求取消"},{"level":2,"text":"请求去重与共享","id":"请求去重与共享"},{"level":2,"text":"依赖请求与串行获取","id":"依赖请求与串行获取"},{"level":2,"text":"请求模式的选择矩阵","id":"请求模式的选择矩阵"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"缓存策略与失效重验证","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-data-fetching-patterns/fundamentals/caching-stale-revalidation"}}